# hosted-human/ — the series

Numbered `.feature` files, one per station of the hosted stage, in the order a person meets them.
Every story here carries `@hosted-human` and one `@concern:<slug>` tag; stations whose story was
born elsewhere are listed in `README.md` by path and are NOT moved (habit checks and pipelines
cite them where they are). New glue lives in `steps/ui/hosted-human.steps.ts`; reuse the portal
primitives in `steps/ui/doorway-portal-login.steps.ts` before defining anything new.

**Considered, no enforcing rule beyond the parent's.** This manifest satisfies the parent
`genesis/a2o/.epr-meta` no-orphan-subtree rule and claims coverage so the walk terminates here.
The series discipline — one life, ordered stations, a story creates and removes its own human
so it runs on any doorway and leaves it clean — is prose in `README.md`, not a mechanizable
predicate.
